---
// Reusable footer extracted from index.astro so all pages can include it.
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <span class="footer-sonda-name">SONDA</span>
        <span class="footer-by-text">by</span>
        <a href="https://solya.studio" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="footer-solya-link">
          <img src="/solya-logo-circle.png" alt="Solya" class="footer-solya-logo" />
          <span>Solya validator</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="https://x.com/SondaNetwork" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="footer-link">@SondaNetwork</a>
        <a href="https://t.me/sonda_network_events" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="footer-link">Telegram</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/SolyaUk/sonda-network" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="footer-link">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
      <div class="footer-sources" id="data-sources">
      <div class="footer-sources-head"><span class="footer-sources-label">Data sources</span><span class="footer-sources-hint">hover an item to see what it provides</span></div><div class="src-groups">
      <span class="src-group"><span class="src-group-l">SONDA's own measurements</span>
        <span data-tip="Snapshots of four clusters every 60 s (mainnet, alpenglow) or 5 min (testnet, devnet), continuously since 2026-04-25, from gossip and validator sets">network snapshots</span><span data-tip="Every node's location cross-checked across four sources with confidence and discrepancy flags (DB-IP primary)">geolocation cross-check</span><span data-tip="Reachability checks of Jito, Harmonic and Solana entrypoints from our own server">endpoint checks</span><span data-tip="Cluster status (live / degraded / halted) derived from all RPC nodes in our chain">cluster status</span><span data-tip="Hand-verified registry of 145 providers with tags, websites, status pages and logos">provider registry</span><span data-tip="Own time series since April 2026: IP and node changes, endpoint status, per-epoch snapshots">history</span>
      </span>
      <span class="src-group"><span class="src-group-l">Solana network</span>
        <span data-tip="JSON-RPC and CLI: gossip nodes, vote accounts and credits, epoch info, feature gates, validator-info. RPC chain: Helius, public RPC, Solya's own nodes">on-chain and RPC</span>
      </span>
      <span class="src-group"><span class="src-group-l">External</span>
        <span data-tip="Primary geolocation">DB-IP</span><span data-tip="Geolocation cross-check">IPInfo</span><span data-tip="Geolocation cross-check">GeoJS</span><span data-tip="Geolocation cross-check">ip-api</span><span data-tip="Kobe API: validator history, MEV data, steward events; BAM explorer: BAM nodes, connected validators, IBRL scores">Jito</span><span data-tip="Malbec API (devices, users, links), network health, multicast groups">DoubleZero</span><span data-tip="Rakurai validator list">Rakurai</span><span data-tip="api.solana.org: historical datacenter locations for the location history">SFDP</span><span data-tip="Epoch dates for history pages; rank and score components">StakeWiz</span><span data-tip="Vote latency, slot duration, MEV commission, SFDP status, name and icon fallback">Trillium</span><span data-tip="ASN holder names and network types for the provider registry (manual verification), bgp.tools for ASN research">RIPE Stat, PeeringDB</span><span data-tip="Client id registry (client_ids.rs) and feature gate catalog">Anza agave</span>
      </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <span>Data updates every ~60 seconds. Last snapshot: <span class="mono" id="footer-ts">--</span></span>
      <span class="footer-attribution">When using SONDA data, attribution is required.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
